            "line": 367,
            "text": "theorem iteratedFDeriv_eq_of_eqOn {S : Set (E × ℝ)} (hS : UniqueDiffOn ℝ S)\n    {f g : E × ℝ → V} (he : EqOn f g S) {q : E × ℝ} (hq : q ∈ S)\n    (hf : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ f q) (hg : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ g q) (n : ℕ) :\n    iteratedFDeriv ℝ n f q = iteratedFDeriv ℝ n g q"
